       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CLAY-5OPERATOR.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-5OP-CLAY-PROOFS.
           05  WS-TWO-LAYER-ABSTR-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SCHUMPETER-COMB-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TEAR-DECOMPOSE-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-REDUCE-REPLACE-ENTROPY   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-5OP-CLAY-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-5OP-CLAY-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-5OP-CLAY-PROVEN      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-5OP-CLAY-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-LAYERS-AND-COMBINE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-DECOMPOSE-AND-ENTROPY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-5OP-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-LAYERS-AND-COMBINE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TWO-LAYER-ABSTR-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SCHUMPETER-COMB-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-DECOMPOSE-AND-ENTROPY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TEAR-DECOMPOSE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-REDUCE-REPLACE-ENTROPY.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-5OP-PROOFS.
           IF WS-TWO-LAYER-ABSTR-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SCHUMPETER-COMB-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TEAR-DECOMPOSE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-REDUCE-REPLACE-ENTROPY = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-5OP-CLAY-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-5OP-CLAY-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-5OP-CLAY-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-5OP-CLAY-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-5OP-CLAY-CODE.
